@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. API đang chạy → 200
GET {{api}}/

### 2. Danh sách bài tập → 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 3. Nộp bài hợp lệ → 201 Created + header Location
# @name nopBai
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "dtc245200279",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/PTUDPTK23/CNTTK23D"
}

### 4. Nộp bài thiếu studentCode → 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/PTUDPTK23/CNTTK23D"
}

### 5. assignmentId <= 0 → 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 0,
  "studentCode": "dtc245200279",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/PTUDPTK23/CNTTK23D"
}

### 6. Đọc lại lượt nộp vừa tạo (chạy request 3 trước) → 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{nopBai.response.body.id}}

### 7. Lượt nộp không tồn tại → 404 Not Found
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
